      "purposeInStoryline": "This is the opening lesson of the sub-strand. It launches the anchoring phenomenon — 'How tall is the water tank without climbing it?' — and opens the Driving Question Board. Learners cannot yet answer the driving question; the lesson is designed to surface prior knowledge, generate genuine puzzlement, and establish the investigative thread that every subsequent lesson will build upon.",
      "safetyNotes": "No chemicals or sharp instruments are used in this lesson. If the class moves outdoors briefly to observe the school water tank, learners must remain on the footpath and not climb any structure. Teacher must conduct a quick headcount before and after any outdoor activity."
